@host = http://localhost:5103

### Check the API is running
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue/items?search=pet

### 1. Create a supplier (starts as Prospect)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "sup-0100",
  "legalName": "Ibadan Bottling Supplies Ltd",
  "taxId": "tin-10000100",
  "contactName": "Bola Ade",
  "contactEmail": "bola@ibadanbottling.example"
}

### Store the new ID
@supplierId = {{create.response.body.id}}

### 2. Try to submit without a category: expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/submit

### 3. Request a category (PKG-BTL, Bottles)
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "01a18cef-01df-770f-bf08-c3029cbd7a39" }

### 4. Submit, then approve
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/submit

###
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/approve

### 5. Approving again: expect 400, it is no longer PendingApproval
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/approve

### 6. Suspend with a reason
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/suspend
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Missed two delivery dates" }

### 7. See the result
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers/{{supplierId}}

### 8. A supplier that doesn't exist: expect 404
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
